.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1105"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--6e9515e3-2497-5444-80ce-9466679d2504","120":"instance--25d30ffe-4a4f-53ec-a34d-de6cc58a2fb0","150":"instance--43abd457-ad7e-5db6-b146-d159a2936c52","180":"instance--f22410a7-1bbd-5943-9121-cf9edb5a0991","210":"instance--4a2a2f86-5543-5514-866c-4d5f4f5bcb3b","240":"instance--f2011b06-5138-5056-a1f2-0a96e9738966","270":"instance--a9d1b1c1-44f0-5281-b6b0-9133e0a433dd","30":"instance--c9339355-ad0b-5e98-9f42-ef0c11d380dd","300":"instance--dec744bc-b6ae-5258-bcb1-83f01a7bb747","330":"instance--54f63fd7-f831-5401-a04f-600f5e780c31","60":"instance--1dd30294-3434-540a-8b5f-d8bc1e3de794","90":"instance--e414165a-d829-5c22-ab74-6aa5e50c83d3"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--25","properties":[["name","Execute ransomware with -smode"],["description","After that, the threat actors used RDP to open a cmd or PowerShell process to then execute the Sodinokibi ransomware using a particular flag -smode, which when executed, wrote a couple RunOnce registry keys and then immediately rebooted the system into Safe Mode with Networking."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0040","technique":"T1486"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ce3f20b8-daf0-5682-a74a-dd9eb1251abb","120":"instance--08418575-7199-5323-8082-8e1d88a1ec11","150":"instance--15627176-59a5-5797-816e-a6cab3ea9da9","180":"instance--242a8d77-274b-5d18-ba35-771f6e0de836","210":"instance--d01bb126-419a-5d3b-a9cf-7b8df1d59112","240":"instance--0b76a14d-f362-5d5a-995f-2e318539789f","270":"instance--d534a23c-ea17-5a19-96f9-740e77b559a2","30":"instance--9b134899-2cf4-5fcd-9412-5363985ac68c","300":"instance--1bb6a59f-c750-5aca-a7c7-cecaf9c9f1f7","330":"instance--a346b253-e85b-53ff-8e33-33aaa8c928da","60":"instance--0c9baf75-2ba0-51ff-b084-c1044ff899fa","90":"instance--b86b5b84-3a18-51f2-b888-17161b8c5d47"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--26","properties":[["name","Create RunOnce persistence key"],["description","The execution of the ransomware executable created a RunOnce key for persistence.\n\nHKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\WOW6432Node\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\RunOnce\\\\*AstraZeneca"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0003","technique":"T1547.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--804d7975-bdc1-5371-a95e-4cff0aa0b8b1","120":"instance--aab4410b-5835-54c6-bc0f-d93b86440850","150":"instance--ad5c3f2a-3c32-5af5-9b9c-489a81eead21","180":"instance--3ff51605-dadf-546e-a273-07184c6549e2","210":"instance--9337c97e-ad0d-5d35-8b01-21c1e3f80296","240":"instance--49c4f7e6-8fe8-5919-bda8-039a2aaf3a61","270":"instance--4e395b92-9587-53cc-a957-cad25cc53df8","30":"instance--b917f3cb-7197-5ba7-8a3e-cbfda092d01a","300":"instance--ab650c26-b6f9-59ed-b26e-6f6ca03758dd","330":"instance--36c16e65-d9d7-519a-a8ae-a6dd521ddceb","60":"instance--0b7fc2fd-f6ca-532d-9f2b-ca34c65a881a","90":"instance--ff765750-9ba6-53a3-b366-8a863df1a603"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--27","properties":[["name","Set Safe Mode boot-out key"],["description","The *franceisshit key was used to boot the machine out of Safe Mode upon restarting the machine."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0003","technique":"T1547.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--5788127e-30a2-5d63-8064-8a764c79ef88","120":"instance--50a9fb8c-a32c-508b-9ff8-6fbad48bdc18","150":"instance--fb5120ee-d53c-50d4-8806-fb538b7ace76","180":"instance--8c9e9207-faff-59a9-9ac0-4db98f799c06","210":"instance--17f4c1e8-e3de-51ca-a9b4-9407a08ef1f5","240":"instance--72709ae2-9e69-5094-89f4-3bb373306fff","270":"instance--4d10667a-8f14-5176-8d94-a90057c253eb","30":"instance--b7f4854d-0cc9-50b4-aae7-a9728bb18935","300":"instance--bb03752f-dd5c-5086-862e-11a1b554f970","330":"instance--ce6fbeb3-82f7-525d-94ba-6314c642da8e","60":"instance--5e319f8b-f917-5aca-9a32-bd424efd643f","90":"instance--923612bb-e746-52ea-b7f5-39eb0184150e"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--28","properties":[["name","Encrypt files after Safe Mode login"],["description","The systems rebooted into Safe Mode with Networking after running this smode command and were left at a login screen. About 10-20 seconds after logging in, all user files were encrypted and a ransom note was placed in numerous locations including the Desktop. Services were not able to be started, which led to collection issues, as normal agents did not start. This also included the startup of EDR and management agents."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0040","technique":"T1486"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--421e596f-663b-56b5-aacb-5c51f44887fb","120":"instance--54341936-f58d-5d7b-9140-0b8f37379212","150":"instance--6ca5d726-fab5-5c69-8490-e3c1002a1e49","180":"instance--00c7f913-8a5c-5e23-a21a-23f0b21c0795","210":"instance--c181f118-448c-5e8f-b83c-d03f6d177344","240":"instance--394b4c0e-56d4-5d48-8d37-2f9f3d5ea7f4","270":"instance--d6c97d2a-eacc-5edb-a7c6-1c3f45f4d771","30":"instance--35925ec4-d6e9-58b5-bd90-5e5a63a45b28","300":"instance--547b5bdf-80a3-54cc-b689-2eb517bfe68a","330":"instance--52fc9239-c76d-586d-b11b-ce234424de7d","60":"instance--ba71b506-6338-5b09-9d9e-61f0f5a2c6b4","90":"instance--a64014df-1f09-5b50-b208-7d398753c7cd"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--29","properties":[["name","Execute ransomware DLL with rundll32"],["description","On certain systems, like the domain controllers, the threat actors chose to not use the Safe Mode option, and instead they used a dll executed by rundll32 to encrypt the system with no reboot, allowing the threat actors to maintain access while the ransomware was encrypting files.\n\nC:\\Windows\\system32\\rundll32.exe\" C:\\Windows\\DomainName.dll,DllRegisterServer"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1218.011"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","The Case Summary states the intrusion leveraged malicious spam using an which, upon opening and enabling the macro, initiated a wmic command to execute the trojan from a remote executable posing as a GIF image."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--2ff8b105-17d8-5bc8-9736-a71ca9281068","120":"instance--fe9b11f7-9a07-51c8-93b2-02f34148833b","150":"instance--15f0676c-2f2f-58cf-99a3-b5eade2d286e","180":"instance--cdc5e3d9-a0b4-5995-98a3-d1a29532ffb1","210":"instance--75ed5df8-ff2f-5667-9748-b8587a1ee318","30":"instance--46009917-4258-54e5-9e91-c46c4a45d34d","330":"instance--54845373-a5f0-5af0-b348-5b0a3b4fbe67","60":"instance--f1f8d9a5-1f2a-55c4-af9a-f2629bc0827a","90":"instance--ddfb6e54-4af9-5771-910f-b4c7ba6e9860","branch:False":"instance--64607b7d-a4bd-56e7-9116-7bc21201c8bf","branch:True":"instance--f635d174-aa29-531f-b9c8-0cc481c6c1dd"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--2","properties":[["description","Encryption did not start immediately after reboot but required a user to log in, which in this case the threat actors completed by logging in after the reboot."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4eb307ac-aee5-51ff-a378-72313cb8c491","120":"instance--0591a2bb-4097-5d84-8f31-ff08a668120e","150":"instance--c7643d66-bba6-51e6-8f22-60f22ce74d3c","180":"instance--f4673565-49da-5b2c-97c0-232d41d2ffcd","210":"instance--e07bf1f6-5982-50bf-b34e-3d7b19116429","240":"instance--41ee5c7d-4848-591e-a5a6-0bfa26f65182","270":"instance--61874d59-cab0-5164-9e5f-b8317ba9cbde","30":"instance--cc1935ec-b811-5b60-9a97-30c04abfe3db","300":"instance--a46ec8e0-7032-58ff-a1da-87b